from parts/poke-radar-charge.replay
# sys-poke-radar (docs/research/berries-honey-radar.md; decomp pokeradar.c, wild_encounters.c, encounter.c): the chain
# is walked to 10 (each Pokémon caught, which keeps the patches more often; with no patch keeping it, the battery is
# charged again and the Radar used again), the best chain is saved, a reload ends the chain and keeps the record.
until radar 10 catch platinum:ITEM_MASTER_BALL 30000
+0 assert state encounters.radarRecords[0].count 10
+0 reload
until idle
+0 assert state encounters.radarRecords[0].count 10
